        "/go/[slug] counts opens via track_source_open, then redirects to GitHub"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Content Engine",
      "items": [
        "Cron fires hourly; the run starts once per Vietnam day at the hour set in /admin",
        "Writes go through RPCs guarded by AIRSC_INGEST_TOKEN",
        "AI work stops when the gateway balance or run cap is hit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Code vs README",
      "items": [
        "README lists Polar checkout routes; no /api/checkout exists at this commit",
